    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="1036" n="1006" sameAs="frus:frus1947v01/pg1006"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">560.AL/10–447: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Troutman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-04T11:00:00+01:00">October 4, 1947—11
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1078. Frito 233. For Wilcox from Brown. Have
                    reached tentative agreement Helmore recommendations to be considered by Cripps
                    and TAC over weekend. Will report in
                        detail.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d510-f1"/> These recommendations <pb
                        facs="1037" n="1007" xml:id="pg1007"/> incorporate all suggestions Toito 243 except (4). Canadian negotiating teams
                    at work and hope have recommendations TAC by
                    middle next week. Will see Coombs today on important issues still unresolved
                    with Australia.</p>
                <p>Sent Dept; repeated London as 128 for Hawkins. [Brown.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Troutman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d510-f1" n="1" xml:id="d510-f1-content">
                <p>This detailed information was sent in telegram 1077 from Geneva, October 4, not
                    printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
